        {
          "text": "Yakobo yaakoba ati: “Nkweghembye, nkobera eriina lyo.” Aye ole yairamu ati: “Lwaki oyenda okumanha eriina lyange?” Agho yaagha Yakobo enkabi agho mu kifo ekyo.",
