        {
          "text": "N'okutuusa mpegaano Abaisiraeli kye bava ni batalya muziisa gwa ku buyungiro bwa kisambi, kuba ku muziisa ogw'oku kisambi kya Yakobo, omusaadha kwe yakuba.",
